{"4801270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashes of Macedonia", "steam_appid": 4801270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ashes of Macedonia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The year is 1917.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On the forgotten Macedonian Front, Greek soldiers stand alongside Allied forces in a brutal war of mud, artillery, and survival. Enemy assaults strike from every direction as the battlefield descends into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are no heroes. No special abilities. No second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight through relentless attacks, conserve precious ammunition, and survive as long as possible against overwhelming odds. Every enemy can kill. Every decision matters. Every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Death is permanent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When your soldier falls, the run ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4801270/extras/b96fe98bec8e5779d82e96b294f1a7d9.avif?t=1784904665\" width=572 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Forgotten Front</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival-focused WW1 first-person shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the historical Macedonian Front</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the war through the eyes of a Greek soldier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath — one life per run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large-scale enemy assaults</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric battlefield immersion</p></li><li><p cl